{
  "info": {
    "name": "Monetiser — API v1",
    "_postman_id": "b7e1c2d4-5f60-4a71-8b92-c3d4e5f60718",
    "description": "Integración sencilla de Monetiser (API v1). Guía: docs/integracion.md del repositorio.\n\nVariables de la colección:\n- host: https://orquestacion-def-test.onrender.com (sandbox)\n- secret: el SECRETO de tu API key (ms_...), de /admin → Merchants → API Keys. NUNCA lo compartas.\n- paymentId: se rellena solo al crear una sesión.\n\nFlujo: 1) Crear sesión → abre la `url` de la respuesta en el navegador (o en /test-checkout.html) y paga con\n4018810000100036 · 12/34 · 123. 2) Consultar el pago → `authorized`. 3) Capturar. 4) Devolver.\n\nLa tarjeta NUNCA se envía a la API: la escribe el comprador en el checkout (PCI DSS SAQ A).\n\nv2.14.0 (nov 2026): peticiones 7-9 (métodos de pago, sesión con país, comprobación de tarjeta guardada desactivada). Las claves nuevas son ms_test_... (las ms_... antiguas siguen valiendo).\n\nv2.15.0 (5 nov 2026): peticiones 10-13 (enlaces de pago con QR). Ver docs/runbook-sesion-5nov.md §C.\n\n(v2.16.0) Carpeta 14: Stripe como segundo PSP, routing de demostración e insights. Variables adminToken, portalToken y merchantId.\n\n(v2.17.0) Carpeta 15: Redsys directo por redirección.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{secret}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "host",
      "value": "https://orquestacion-def-test.onrender.com"
    },
    {
      "key": "secret",
      "value": "ms_PEGA_AQUI_TU_SECRETO"
    },
    {
      "key": "paymentId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "linkId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "adminToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "portalToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "merchantId",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Crear sesión de pago",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Idempotency-Key",
            "value": "{{$guid}}"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{host}}/v1/checkout-sessions",
          "host": [
            "{{host}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "v1",
            "checkout-sessions"
          ]
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"amount\": 4999,\n  \"currency\": \"EUR\",\n  \"reference\": \"PEDIDO-1234\",\n  \"returnUrl\": \"https://orquestacion-def-test.onrender.com/gracias.html\"\n}"
        },
        "description": "Devuelve la `url` del checkout. Guarda el `id` en la variable paymentId. Con la misma Idempotency-Key devolvería la misma sesión."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "const b = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('201 sesión creada', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 201]));",
              "if (b && b.id) { pm.collectionVariables.set('paymentId', b.id); console.log('Abre para pagar:', b.url); }"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Consultar la sesión",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{host}}/v1/checkout-sessions/{{paymentId}}",
          "host": [
            "{{host}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "v1",
            "checkout-sessions",
            "{{paymentId}}"
          ]
        },
        "description": "`status`: open | processing | complete | expired. `result`: pending | succeeded | failed."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Consultar el pago",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{host}}/v1/payments/{{paymentId}}",
          "host": [
            "{{host}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "v1",
            "payments",
            "{{paymentId}}"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Estado, importes capturado/devuelto y tarjeta truncada."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Capturar (cobrar)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Idempotency-Key",
            "value": "{{$guid}}"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{host}}/v1/payments/{{paymentId}}/capture",
          "host": [
            "{{host}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "v1",
            "payments",
            "{{paymentId}}",
            "capture"
          ]
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{}"
        },
        "description": "Sin `amount` captura todo lo autorizado. Para una parte: {\"amount\": 2000}."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "5. Devolver (parcial)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Idempotency-Key",
            "value": "{{$guid}}"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{host}}/v1/payments/{{paymentId}}/refund",
          "host": [
            "{{host}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "v1",
            "payments",
            "{{paymentId}}",
            "refund"
          ]
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"amount\": 1000,\n  \"reason\": \"Devolución de prueba\"\n}"
        },
        "description": "Exige captura previa (si no: 409 capture_required → usa Anular)."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "6. Anular (sin capturar)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Idempotency-Key",
            "value": "{{$guid}}"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{host}}/v1/payments/{{paymentId}}/cancel",
          "host": [
            "{{host}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "v1",
            "payments",
            "{{paymentId}}",
            "cancel"
          ]
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{}"
        },
        "description": "Libera la retención de un pago `authorized` que no se ha capturado."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "7. Métodos de pago disponibles",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{host}}/v1/payment-methods",
          "host": [
            "{{host}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "v1",
            "payment-methods"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Catálogo con disponibilidad real. Esperado: card disponible; bizum/apple_pay/google_pay con available:false y motivo."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "const b = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('200', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(200));",
              "pm.test('tarjeta disponible', () => pm.expect(b.data.find(m => m.method === 'card').available).to.eql(true));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
