    {
      "name": "14. Stripe, routing de demo e insights (v2.16.0)",
      "description": "Runbook completo: docs/stripe.md. Variables nuevas: adminToken (token de POST /backoffice/auth/login de un superadmin), portalToken (token de POST /portal/auth/login), merchantId (el comercio de pruebas).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "14.1 /admin: guardar cuenta Stripe de pruebas",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{host}}/backoffice/merchants/{{merchantId}}/connector-accounts/stripe/credentials",
              "host": [
                "{{host}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "backoffice",
                "merchants",
                "{{merchantId}}",
                "connector-accounts",
                "stripe",
                "credentials"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Esperado 200 con account.credentials.test.configured = true y las claves enmascaradas. Más cómodo desde /admin → Merchants → Adquirentes. 400 si una clave no es de pruebas. 404 unknown_connector si falta FEATURE_STRIPE=true + deploy.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{adminToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"mode\": \"test\",\n  \"credentials\": {\n    \"secretKey\": \"sk_test_PEGA_AQUI\",\n    \"publishableKey\": \"pk_test_PEGA_AQUI\",\n    \"webhookSecret\": \"whsec_PEGA_AQUI\"\n  }\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "14.2 /admin: aplicar routing de demostración",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{host}}/backoffice/routing/{{merchantId}}/demo-preset",
              "host": [
                "{{host}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "backoffice",
                "routing",
                "{{merchantId}}",
                "demo-preset"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Esperado 200: EUR + ES → payNoPain; resto → stripe; fallback al otro antes de pedir la tarjeta.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{adminToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{}"
            }
          }
        },
